    "sentence_translations": [
      "The Story of the Chicken",
      "",
      "2017 is the year of the rooster.",
      "The chicken is a very important animal in China.",
      "People initially started to keep chickens in their households in Northern China about 11 thousand years ago.",
      "At first, people kept chickens not for the meat, ..",
      ".. but because roosters crowed every morning at 4 or 5 o’clock and woke people up.",
      "There is an idiom called “the rooster announces the morning”.",
      "It means that roosters crow on time and tell people when the day is breaking.",
      "Since “chicken” and “lucky” have similar pronunciations, people regard chickens as lucky animals.",
      "During Chinese New Year, you may wish your Chinese friends to be “lucky in the year of the rooster”."
    ]
